{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123018","id":4399151793,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBjW6sQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123018.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123018/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123018/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123018/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dacb6e6c7b7edb95928e21c49801f3e58e6146fd","number":123018,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"Fix spawn packet size check overflow allowing OOB read","user":{"login":"binarycurious","id":91041518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMDQxNTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91041518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious","html_url":"https://github.com/binarycurious","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binarycurious/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n\r\n`SceneReplicationInterface::on_spawn_receive()` validated the spawn packet length with `name_len + (sync_len * 4)` evaluated in 32-bit math. Because `sync_len` is an attacker-controlled `uint32_t` read straight from the packet, the product wraps: `0x40000001 * 4 == 4`. The bounds check then passes for a minimally sized packet, and the following loop iterates `sync_len` times reading 4 bytes per iteration, walking far past the end of the buffer.\r\n\r\nThe comparison is now done in signed 64-bit, where the operands cannot overflow across their full input range. This also bounds the number of sync ids to the packet size, so a single 4-byte field can no longer drive unbounded `List<uint32_t>` allocation.\r\n\r\nReachable by any connected peer that is the authority of a `MultiplayerSpawner`, and by a malicious server against clients.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos